 "solution": [
  "Factorise the top, taking out the common factor ${=m}x$: ${=m}x^3-{=m*(p+q)}x^2+{=m*p*q}x={=m}x\\left(x^2-{=p+q}x+{=p*q}\\right)={=m}x(x-{=p})(x-{=q})$.",
